{"n": 585, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "585.webp", "text": "32-10\n\n3231061 REPLACING (UPPER) STEER-\nING SPINDLE\n\nDisconnect battery ground lead.\nRemove and install steering wheel 32 33 000.\nRemove instrument panel trim.\n\nRemove steering column casing lower section.\n\nDisconnect tufn signal and wiper switch\n\nRemove collar ring (1).\n\nInstallation:\n\nNotch of collar ring (1) must lock snap ring\n(2).\n\n2632030\n\n323050\n\n3032015\n\nRemove snap ring (1), washer (2), spring (3)\nand ring (4)\n\n(nstallation:\n\nStem of ring (4) faces bearing.\n\nInstallation:\n\nInstall snap ring (1) with Special Tools 32 3 052\nand 23 3 050 (knock from hammer and steering\nspindle held on bottom).\n\nLift out steering spindle bearings with a\nscrewdriver.\n\nInstallation:\n\nFor steering spindles with groove in area of\nbearing, insert and lightly coat O-ring with\ngrease.\n\nDrive in bearing with Special Tool 00 5 550.\n\nRemove bolt (1) and loosen bolt (2).\n\nPress steering spindle off of steering gear and\nremove.\n\nInstallation:\n\nBolt (1) must be located in locking groove of\nsteering shaft.\n\nReplace self-locking nuts.\n\nTightening torque\".\n\n* See Specifications", "words": [["32-10", 0.4732, 0.0318, 0.537, 0.0544], ["3231061", 0.2695, 0.0676, 0.3171, 0.0796], ["REPLACING", 0.3313, 0.0683, 0.3941, 0.0796], ["(UPPER)", 0.3982, 0.0683, 0.4397, 0.0802], ["STEER-", 0.4443, 0.0683, 0.4823, 0.0796], ["ING", 0.3313, 0.0836, 0.3501, 0.0948], ["SPINDLE", 0.3536, 0.0836, 0.3997, 0.0948], ["Disconnect", 0.2695, 0.116, 0.3222, 0.1273], ["battery", 0.3257, 0.1167, 0.3597, 0.1293], ["ground", 0.3627, 0.1167, 0.3961, 0.1293], ["lead.", 0.3997, 0.1167, 0.421, 0.1273], ["Remove", 0.27, 0.1326, 0.308, 0.1432], ["and", 0.311, 0.1326, 0.3283, 0.1432], ["install", 0.3323, 0.1326, 0.3587, 0.1432], ["steering", 0.3632, 0.1326, 0.3992, 0.1459], ["wheel", 0.4022, 0.1326, 0.4291, 0.1432], ["32", 0.4331, 0.1326, 0.4448, 0.1432], ["33", 0.4483, 0.1326, 0.46, 0.1432], ["000.", 0.4635,